      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.07,
      "end_seconds": 27.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Uh-huh. How intense does it get?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.25,
      "end_seconds": 42.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "text": "I mean, a six out of ten, I suppose there was a blotchy rash on the trunk, yes, but that went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.78,
      "end_seconds": 50.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "so, have you had fever and joint pains before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.49,
      "end_seconds": 56.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "I had a similar thing last winter. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
